\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 2-IMF warns against big Argentine  \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Louise Egan \par \uc2 574 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Januar 2002\par 20:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Jan 18 (Reuters) - A senior International Monetary Fund official on Friday warned against large \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the Argentine \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, which she said would be "questionable." \par \par \uc2  The IMF's Anne Krueger, who has been critical of Argentina's new dual exchange rate, said recent dollar sales by the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the newly-floated peso were small scale. \par \par \uc2  "They are small \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  that basically smooth out fluctuations and are in small amounts. I think one might make a case for it. I think large scale \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be probably very questionable," Krueger, the lending body's first deputy managing director, told a news conference in Chile. \par \par \uc2  The Argentine \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the fourth straight day Friday in an attempt to stop a devaluation of the peso from spinning out of control and adding to the bankrupt country's economic crisis. \par \par \uc2  Latin America's third-largest economy this month abandoned a decade-old \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  peg to the U.S. dollar and introduced a dual exchange system, with one official fixed rate of 1.40 pesos a dollar and a floating peso for cash deals. \par \par \uc2  In the first week of trade, the floating \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has fallen sharply, forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The bank sold an unspecified amount of dollars Friday at 1.85 pesos, although the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  later withered to 1.95/2.00 per dollar by midday as nervous buyers sought refuge in dollars on fears the country would sink even further into chaos. \par \par \uc2  The IMF has not looked kindly on the dual exchange rate, but was encouraged by Argentina's statement this week it hoped to float the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  completely within five months. \par \par \uc2  "A unified exchange rate system is the only system that is workable in the long term," Krueger said Friday. \par \par \uc2  LOAN ACCORD \par \par \uc2  Krueger also said she doubted Argentina would get a loan accord with the IMF within a month, a time frame Argentina said was feasible. \par \par \uc2  "I think it would be very difficult to have anything within a month," she said. \par \par \uc2  Argentina has said it could request up to $20 billion in fresh aid to see it through what promises to be a turbulent 2002. \par \par \uc2  Krueger said the new Argentine government had not yet formally asked for support and that, even if it did so now, the process of IMF approval would not be that fast. \par \par \uc2  The lender last month froze a $1.3 billion payment on its overall $22 billion package to Argentina because the government failed to curb spending as promised. \par \par \uc2  Krueger reiterated the IMF position that it will help Argentina, which has defaulted on part of its $141 billion public debt, once the country comes up with a sustainable economic plan. \par \par \uc2  In addition to scrapping the twin \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  system, the lender wants to see Argentina craft a new monetary policy, restore the banking system, complete its budget and agree on mechanisms for renegotiating debt with creditors, she said. \par \par \uc2  "Those are the broad outlines of what would be required to get fund support, but how the authorities choose to do that is their choice," she said. \par \par \uc2  A technical mission is currently in Argentina, working with Argentine officials monetary and banking problems. A second mission to look at debt and fiscal issues will land in Buenos Aires early next week, Krueger said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020118dy1i00x6l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
