\par\par \b \uc2  Chilean peso firms on  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 September 2001\par 23:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Sept 28 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso firmed on Friday following a decisive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to break an initial slide in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  The peso gained 0.46 percent to finish at 693.00/693.30 compared to record lows of 696.20/696.50 on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The peso came under heavy pressure from a high demand for dollars early in the session, forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  three times. The final and most effective injection of dollars came moments before close. \par \par \uc2  "Early injection of dollars from the bank was too small, meaning the market absorbed them immediately and the peso continued to fall," one trader said. \par \par \uc2  According to an informal Reuters survey after the market closed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $38 million. \par \par \uc2  Traders said a slowing world economy following the recent attacks on the United States, a lack of liquidity in the market and the constant prospect of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would keep the exchange rate highly volatile. \par \par \uc2  "It's difficult to make predictions for the short term, its not even easy to predict trends on a day-to-day basis as there are so many factors that come into play," said Pedro Verdugo, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager at Mercury Travel in Santiago. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has now sold an estimated $302 million from its reserves in the money market since mid-August, when it broke with a two-year hands-off policy. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010928dx9s014fs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
