\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk Pres: \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Mkt  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Not To Fix Peso \b0\par\par\uc2 471 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 September 2001\par 18:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  president Carlos Massad said Friday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent dollar sales on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market aim to maintain liquidity, not set a fixed limit on the Chilean peso. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are not seeking a determined price for the dollar, but maintaining a degree of liquidity and order on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," Massad said, speaking to reporters on the sidelines of a government seminar with local businessmen. \par \par \uc2  The bank announced in mid-August that it was willing to use up to $2 billion in international reserves to sell dollars directly on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in an effort to halt the Chilean peso's free-fall in previous months. \par \par \uc2  The bank then made good on its warning on Aug. 28, surprising markets with its first direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since abandoning its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  band two years ago. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold dollars on the market twice since then, the most recent time on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  At 1615 GMT Friday, the Chilean peso was trading at CLP666.50 to the dollar, weaker than Thursday's close of CLP664.30. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which had lost as much as 17% of its value this year, has strengthened 3.8% since the bank's mid-August announcement. \par \par \uc2  Market players, however, have been teasing the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weaker since Aug. 28 to test at what levels the bank will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders have said. \par \par \uc2  In the meantime, total daily volumes on the spot market have sunk to between $200 million and $300 million, compared with the previously seen daily average volumes of about $500 million. \par \par \uc2  Massad said Friday that the bank will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market "regularly but not mechanically" through the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  In the meantime, he said the weaker Chilean peso is helping the country's exports without risking the bank's 2% to 4% target range for its inflation outlook in the medium term. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary policy-making board on Thursday opted to maintain its benchmark target lending rate at a nominal 6.50%, saying that inflation was still within its target range. \par \par \uc2  That's despite signs in the government's most recent inflation report that the weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is passing through to prices. Inflation in August came in at a higher-than-expected 0.8%. \par \par \uc2  Massad on Thursday reiterated the bank's pledge to closely watch the effect of the weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on inflation and act when necessary. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reported earlier Friday that in spite of selling $36.5 million on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in August, its foreign reserves grew or 1.4% to $14.68 billion during the month, compared with July. \par \par \uc2  -By Christen A. Jamar, Dow Jones Newswires; 562-460-8546; chile@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010907dx97000zq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
