\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  cenbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to prop up peso. \b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 August 2001\par 20:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Aug 31 (Reuters) - The Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday, selling millions of dollars to defend the peso for the second time this week, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The involvement of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  failed to bolster the peso, which weakened 0.42 percent to close at 664.50/665.00 pesos to the U.S. dollar, compared with Thursday's finish of 661.70/662.00. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the amount of dollars sold was probably no more than $10 million, insufficient to offset strong demand for dollars ahead of a long weekend. \par \par \uc2  "What happened today was basically people closing positions for the three days they have to wait before the ???gain," said Ivette Linares, analyst at Inverlink brokerage. \par \par \uc2  Markets are closed on Monday for National Reconcily???Day. \par \par \uc2  The Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has depreciated about 15 percent since the start of the year because of fears of a debt default or devaluation in neighboring Argentina, Latin America's third-largest economy. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold around $14 million dollars, according to a Reuters survey of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders. It was the first time the institution pumped dollars directly into the market since it floated the peso in 1999. \par \par \uc2  The bank announced on Aug. 16 it would withdraw up to $2 billion from its reserves in the remainder of 2001 to pump into the market. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010831dx8v00vsp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
