\par\par \b \uc2  Chile may raise rates to curb inflation - economist. \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 November 1999\par 21:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, Nov 4 (Reuters) - One of Chile's top economists, Vittorio Corbo, on Thursday said he doubted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to shore up the softening peso, though that it could raise interest rates to keep a lid on inflation. \par \par \uc2  The peso, which has weakened nearly 15 percent this year, closed at 549.40/549.70 per dollar on Thursday compared with the previous session's 548.10/548.40. \par \par \uc2  "I believe that if we wake up tomorrow and see the exchange rate at 600 pesos, that will accelerate inflation very quickly," Corbo, an adviser to Banco Santander in \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , told reporters. "That is when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but not by selling dollars but most likely by raising interest rates." \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Carlos Massad on Thursday said his institution is not thinking about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "Right now, we are not worried about that," Massad said. "Naturally, we must continue observing the situation, but the exchange rate is not a worrisome element." \par \par \uc2  As a financial crisis took root in Asia, the peso began a sharp slide in October 1997, when it was trading around 412 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  In September 1999, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  abandoned its system for controlling the exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  ((Santiago newsroom, +562 370-4252, fax +562 696-0161)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010909dvb400ma3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
