\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  band. The dolar acuerdo is based on a trade-weighted \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been widening the band by 0.013575 percentage point a day. At the end of July, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Carlos Massad said the band was plus or minus 11% to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 03-09-99 \par \par \uc2  0006GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv9306hdh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
