\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Peso Ends Stronger Following Ctrl Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Juli 1998\par 20:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--The Chilean peso ended trading Wednesday stronger against the dollar following dollar sales by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said a local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader. An official with the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not confirm or deny the reported \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  On the interbank market, the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded in a range between 467.00 pesos and 470.00 pesos to the dollar. One dollar bought 467.00 pesos at the end of trading day, two pesos less than the previous session's closing price. \par \par \uc2  The trader said pressure was on the dollar to strengthen Wednesday, as the market was nervous over the potential for a further depreciation of the peso. The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he added, came out to defend the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the dollar hit 470.00. "It's clear the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't want the peso falling any further than 470," the trader said. \par \par \uc2  He added that the market is still absorbing the effects of the economic measures announced last Thursday evening by the government. Among the reforms was a narrowing of the exchange rate band in which the peso floats. The band places a floor of 3.5% below the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's "dolar de acuerdo", and a ceiling of 2% above it. Previously the exchange rate was allowed to swing 12.5% in either direction of the dolar de acuerdo. \par \par \uc2  The dollar finished last Thursday, before the reforms were announced, at 457.45 pesos. \par \par \uc2  On debt markets, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's eight-year PRC bonds were trading to yield 7.62% on an annual basis at the end of the day, compared to the previous session's 7.85% close. \par \par \uc2  By Felipe Ossa (562) 638 7472 \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 01-07-98 \par \par \uc2  1801GMT \par \par \uc2  1170 1844 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du7105jyt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
