\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2 's Peso Ends Stronger On  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 223 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1998\par 18:13\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--The Chilean peso ended trading stronger against the dollar Tuesday on a series of dollar sales by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at a local bank. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official declined to comment on the reported \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  On the interbank market, the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded in a range between 453.70 pesos and 454.40 pesos to the dollar. One dollar bought 453.70 pesos at the end of trading day, 30 centavos less than the previous session's closing price. \par \par \uc2  The trader said the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  was forced to repeatedly defend the peso Tuesday as the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could not stand on its own. \par \par \uc2  "I don't think anything economic put downward pressure on the peso," said the trader, adding that the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was probably uneasy about tension surrounding Gen. Augusto Pinochet's stepping down Tuesday as commander of the army. He is expected to assume the post of senator for life on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  On debt markets, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's eight-year PRC bonds were trading to yield 7.30% on an annual basis at the end of the day, compared with the previous session's 7.25% close. \par \par \uc2  -By Felipe Ossa (562) 638 7472 \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires  10-03-98 \