\par\par \b \uc2  Chile econ minister comfortable with peso fall. \b0\par\par\uc2 329 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, Jan 13 (Reuters) - Chile's government is comfortable with the recent weakening of the peso against the dollar, seeing it as a readjustment of the peso's 1997 rise, Economy Minister Alvaro Garcia said on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "I am happy with the current price of the dollar despite its price of 438 pesos at the end of 1997 as it is only a rebalance of the rise of the peso (during that year)," Garcia told reporters. \par \par \uc2  The peso currently stands at 466.95 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Garcia said that the peso had gained an average eight percent in 1997, adding that its current price is similar to its price at the beginning of last year. \par \par \uc2  The peso's fall has been put down to the on-going Asian crisis and its impact on \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's economy. The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market five times in the last 10 days in an attempt to smooth the fall. \par \par \uc2  Garcia said that the rate of the dollar against the peso was in line with the government's export policies and that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies were sufficient to avoid speculative attacks against the peso. The bank raised rates last week. \par \par \uc2  "We mustn't forget that we have improved our \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  position in relation to Europe and I would hope that when the traders finish changing their portfolios versus the dollar, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will stabilize," he said. \par \par \uc2  Garcia said there was no point in changing the country's restrictions on foreign capital inflows. \par \par \uc2  "In the middle of this turbulence we are not at the best time to consider changes in this sort of measure," he said. \par \par \uc2  Garcia said the depreciation of the peso in the last few weeks would strengthen Chile's export sector and would improve its competitive edge in the aftermath of the Asian crisis. ((Gabriela Donoso, Santiago Newsroom, 562 699-5595 x228))s \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du1d07y0m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
