\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Peso Strengthens; Attributed To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Januar 1998\par 18:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--The Chilean peso ended trading Friday stronger against the dollar after the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised interest rates Thursday evening, but traders said the peso's rise was due more to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  then to its rate increase. \par \par \uc2  On the interbank market, the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded in a range between 457.00 pesos and 462.00 pesos to the dollar. One dollar bought 459.00 pesos at the end of trading day, four pesos less than the previous session's closing price. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  raised the interbank lending rate by 50 basis points, to 7.00%. \par \par \uc2  Two \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had sold dollars Friday, but an official with the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined comment on the reports. \par \par \uc2  One of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders said the interest rate increase had been largely anticipated by the market and proved ineffective Friday in combating pressures from the ongoing declines of many Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . 'What's still lacking are aggressive measures by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  that show it will defend the peso,' the trader said. 'Until they do that, the market will keep testing them.' \par \par \uc2  On debt markets, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's eight-year PRC bonds were trading to yield 6.99% on an annual basis at the end of the day, compared to the previous session's 7.01% close. \par \par \uc2  By William Hoke (562) 639 7895 \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 09-01-98 \par \par \uc2  1748GMT \par \par \uc2  1170 1844 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du19008pg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
