\par\par \b \uc2  PRESS DIGEST - Chile - December 3. \b0\par\par\uc2 560 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, Dec 3 (Reuters) - The following are some of the stories on the Chilean front pages this morning. Reuters has not necessarily verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy. \par \par \uc2  EL MERCURIO \par \par \uc2  - Chile's November CPI comes in at a low 0.1 percent, due to a fall in the price of clothing and no change in the prices of communications and transport. Food prices, blamed for October's CPI of 1.2 percent, only rose 0.2 percent in the following month. Inflation so far this year reaches 5.9 percent, making it impossible to reach the 5.5 target set for 1997. \par \par \uc2  - Local environmental regulatory board Corema rejects Public Works Ministry's report on the expected impact of a new motorway to be built in Santiago. They demand further investigation of gas emissions and vehicle flow. \par \par \uc2  - Government concerned by delays in agreement over Campo de Hielo border with Argentina as any negotiations already completed may become null and void after Chile's December 11 elections. \par \par \uc2  - Sanitary works commission in Valparaiso agree to a plan to build an aqueduct from Concon, in the coastal mountain range, to the seaside town of Zapallar to ensure its supply of drinking water. \par \par \uc2  ESTRATEGIA \par \par \uc2  - Chilean timber products holding company CMPC buys 46.5 percent of wood pulp plant Celulosa del Pacifico from U.S. firm Simpson Paper, upping its stake to 93 percent. \par \par \uc2  - 0.1 percent rise in November's CPI brings inflation for 12- months to end November to 6.3 percent. \par \par \uc2  - U.S. dollar was the best investment in Chile in November as stock market crashes made \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  buying more attractive. \par \par \uc2  - Price of copper could fall as low as $0.70 per pound in the next few months. \par \par \uc2  - December will be a key month for the alliance between Spanish utility Endesa and local electricity group Enersis as privatization deals interesting both parties will be put up for sale early next year. \par \par \uc2  - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for the third time in a week, selling at least $100 million to stabilize the fall of the peso. The bank seems to be defending an informal ceiling dollar price of 440 pesos. The peso closed at 436.5 to a dollar. \par \par \uc2  EL DIARIO \par \par \uc2  - Western hemisphere finance ministers' meeting opens with discussion on capital flows controls. Chile's Eduardo Aninat says financial openness requires management of capital flows in and out of a country. His Argentine counterpart, Roque Fernandez, says the Chilean system is discriminatory. President of the Chilean Banking Association, Hernan Somerville, considers the proliferation of regulations in the region dangerous. \par \par \uc2  - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's three \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in the last week could have cost about $200 million. \par \par \uc2  - Representatives of French supermarket chain Carrefour arrive in Chile to work to open three stores in Chile. \par \par \uc2  - Chile's CMPC acquires 100 percent of B shares in Celulosa del Pacifico. It also has major control, owning 93.04 percent of voting series A shares after buying out partner Simpson Paper Co. Other shares are held by the International Finance Corporation. \par \par \uc2  - Argentine energy company YPF says it will start bringing gasoline and diesel fuel into the Chilean market in 1998, currently 90 percent controlled by Chilean state- owned oil firm ENAP. \par \par \uc2  ((Santiago newsroom, +562 699-5595 x 212)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtc301is6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
